{"generation_call_already_reserved":true,"id":"legal_skill_evolution_mixed_component_training_status_schema_20261115:read:7a41aa644c23ea9bcedc90c21b076892ad11cd47cf54cbd4853cb1f755bb278a","payload":{"chat_template_kwargs":{"enable_thinking":false},"max_tokens":8192,"messages":[{"content":"在一次完整 facts 读取中分别输出 payments、services、conditions、terminations 和 retirements。付款只由明确付款措辞建立，保留 payer、payee、amount、medium、实际完整日期或仅年度精度；year_only 不生成付款 start_。服务保留 worker、employer、kind、venue、location/country 和自身端点；domestic service 不表示 private home。condition 只接受明确 disability 或 death 陈述。termination 只接受明确就业终止，并链接已读取 service_local_id；retirement 只接受明确退休。普通工资不要求 termination，终止也不能自动建立付款、死亡、残疾或退休。查询标记只能对齐 facts 已建立的唯一付款或服务。所有记录必须有 facts witness。\nShared native event meanings: Shared factual encoding from the author statute program:\nservice_(event), agent_(service,worker), patient_(service,employer).\npayment_(event), agent_(payment,payer), patient_(payment,payee),\npurpose_(payment,service_event), amount_(payment,amount).\npurpose_(service,\"domestic service\"|\"agricultural labor\") is a stated service kind.\nmarriage_(event) has an agent_ fact for EACH spouse.\ndeath_(event) has agent_(event,deceased), start_(event,actual_death_date).\nenrollment_(event) has agent_(event,student), patient_(event,institution).\nattending_classes_(event) has agent_(event,student), location_(event,institution).\neducational_institution_(event) has agent_(event,institution).\nincome_(event) has agent_(event,recipient), amount_(event,amount).\nstart_/end_ describe the dates/period of that SAME event, not arbitrary dates\nbelonging to a different event. A stated annual income can be represented over\nits stated calendar year with canonical year bounds; this does not invent the\ndate of an instantaneous payment. Never allocate a cross-year payment or give\nit a payment date copied from a service period without support.\n\nExplicit source-stated intermediate legal givens, with ordered arguments:\ns151_b_applies(taxpayer:string,spouse:string,year:integer)\ns151_c_applies(taxpayer:string,dependent:string,year:integer)\ns63_f_1_A(taxpayer:string,year:integer)\ns63_f_1_B(taxpayer:string,spouse:string,year:integer)\ns151_b(taxpayer:string,exemption_amount:number,year:integer)\ns152_c_1(dependent:string,taxpayer:string,year:integer)\nKeep source polarity and taxpayer/beneficiary direction. A151(d) statement is not automatically a151(b)/(c) fact. Never assert the target predicate or infer unstated ages, deaths or relationships. This is shared infrastructure, not learned legal knowledge.","role":"system"},{"content":"{\"task\": {\"current_case\": {\"facts\": \"Alice has paid $3200 to Bob for domestic service done from Feb 1st, 2017 to Sep 2nd, 2017. Bob has paid $4500 to Alice for work done from Apr 1st, 2017 to Sep 2nd, 2018.\", \"question\": \"Alice is an employer under section 3306(a)(1) for the year 2018.\\nNative query constraints from this same original TRAIN task (truth value not supplied): s3306_a_1(\\\"Alice\\\",2018).\"}, \"current_legal_query\": {\"native_query\": [{\"arguments\": [\"Alice\", 2018], \"predicate\": \"s3306_a_1\"}], \"query_clause\": \"s3306_a_1\"}, \"component_meanings\": {\"payment_service_events\": \"一般就业发生视图：分别完整读取付款、服务、残疾或死亡条件、就业终止和退休，并仅通过本地标识连接来源明确的关系。\"}}, \"output_schema\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"properties\": {\"payment_service_events\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"additionalProperties\": false, \"required\": [\"views\"], \"properties\": {\"views\": {\"type\": \"array\", \"minItems\": 1, \"items\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"additionalProperties\": false, \"required\": [\"extraction_status\", \"payments\", \"services\", \"conditions\", \"terminations\", \"retirements\", \"witnesses\"], \"properties\": {\"extraction_status\": {\"enum\": [\"complete\", \"unread\"]}, \"payments\": {\"type\": [\"array\", \"null\"], \"items\": {\"type\": \"object\", \"additionalProperties\": false, \"required\": [\"local_id\", \"payer\", \"payee\", \"amount\", \"medium\", \"